   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0408_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʾsp̄pʾṭˈ MN ẔK Y ʿL
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>bwnˈ lwcyk Y BYRḤ ʾṭwrˈ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>W BYRḤ ddwˈ Y ŠNṬ $X-II Y
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>kwlṭwdy lʾd ḤS-$$$ ○
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>dwlkˈ ʾḤRN Y PRŠYʾ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>GBRʾ-I ḤS-$ ○ dwlk[
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ dynʾp̄ẕwṭˈ
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ ○○
                                            top vertically dhḵ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0408_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Aspbād az ān ī ō
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>bun rōzīg ī māh Ādur
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ud māh Day ī sāl 32 ī
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>Kurdōy rāy may 60 ○
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>dōlag any ī aswār
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>mard 1 may 20 ○ dōlag
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>dād čak Dēnabzūd
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>āwišt ○○
                                            top vertically dahag
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0408_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1-2" xml:id="trans-p1-l1-2"/>[1–2] Aspbād from that which (belongs) to the bun, on behalf of the ration of month Ādur (9th month)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>and month Day (10th month) of year 32 of
               <lb n="4-5" xml:id="trans-p1-l4-5"/>Kurdōy gave 60 pails of wine, for each single horseman
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>20 pails of wine.
               <lb n="7-8" xml:id="trans-p1-l7-8"/>Dēnabzūd sealed the čak. 
               —top vertically: *issuing office.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
